Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:05.769 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  the annual Academy of Country Music  Awards may have been postponed until  September 16 due to the corona virus  pandemic but that didn't stop the live  performances from taking place during  the show's original time flock more than  20 country artists joined forces Sunday  evening for a two hour television  special featuring acting performances  intimate conversations and a look back  at past ACM Awards moments with Gayle  King serving as host Sunday's show  reminded us all the important healing  power that music has especially in times  like ease I sit on this porch and I've  done a lot of healing a lot of thinking  right here and I actually got married  right here my husband was supposed to  film this but he's fishing at the pond  and I figure for a new york city boy you  better learn how to fish so I'll let him  do that  [Music]  following touching performances from  Dierks Bentley Florida Georgia line  Little Big Town and many more a trio of  superstars closed up the show with a  powerful tribute to Kenny Rogers who  passed away on March 20th at the age of  81 Brad Paisley and Darius Rucker  honored Kenny's long legacy in country  music with a virtual performance of his  hip like the feel and the gambler and  Lionel Richie closed up the tribute with  a reflection on their friendship which  began when Lionel rode Kenny's famous  1980s head lady not only did we have a  hit record but I found one of the  greatest friends I ever had in my whole  life the loss of him is tremendous on my  heart the memory the memories it's  unbelievable we live so much life  together and tonight I want to celebrate  his life  and I want to say to all of his fans he  enjoyed the ride

